{
    "title": "Golf Rival - Multiplayer Game",
    "description": "The golf course is calling - it\u2019s time to become a pro golf champion in Golf Rival! \r\n\r\nGolf Rival is a free-to-play multiplayer PvP golf game where great golf skills meet infinite golf creativity. Collect powerful golf clubs and balls and tee off across over 300+ courses in more than 20+ themes! Satisfy your golf dreams of hitting incredible shots, climbing the leaderboards and proving you\u2019re a golf game master. Let\u2019s go for a perfect swing and hit that hole-in-one, golfers!\r\n\r\nThis exciting free golf game has many modes to play and master, all from your mobile phone. From 1v1 PvP golf, to Tournament mode where it\u2019s you against the community of golfers around the world, to playing golf with friends - in Golf Rival, scoring a birdie is only the start of the competitive fun! Use powerful balls and clubs to outwit your opponent, as no two fun multiplayer golf battles are the same. \r\n\r\nGolf Rival also now includes a brand-new MINI GOLF mode, complete with putt putt puzzles and mini golf battles designed to see if you\u2019re truly a top golfer. Think outside the box to solve these tricky holes with curves, power shots and more!\r\n\r\nGrab your golf clubs, because Golf Rival has it all, whether you\u2019re a golfing games newbie or a sports game expert!\r\n\r\nPLAY EXCITING GOLF GAMES\r\n-Complete stages and unlock incredible new golf challenges to conquer by winning real-time golf battles\r\n-Master your golf swing with precision and creativity to watch your skills grow\r\n-Compete in both 9-hole and 18-hole Tournaments in every exciting season\r\n-Multiplayer mode, mini golf mode and other challenges await for you to play every day\r\n-Beautiful 3D golf courses of different themes and difficulties will always present a realistic golf challenge\r\n\r\nGROW YOUR GOLF SKILLS\r\n-Playing a golf simulation like Golf Rival is unlike any free golf games you\u2019ve tried before thanks to creative and fantastical clubs and balls\r\n-Win to unlock amazing rewards to take onto the course for your next round and enhance your golf bag\r\n-With every exciting real-time golf clash, you\u2019ll gain important skills and tricks to hit extreme golf shots!\r\n\r\nINFINITE GOLF FUN\r\n-Every Golf Rival season is fun and fresh, with new courses, balls and rewards appearing all the time!\r\n-Golf ball games and skill games like Kingdom, Ace Open, Brink Game and more provide you with many fun spins on classic golf. \r\n-Add your friends and see who has the swag golf skills needed to become the #1 golfer!\r\n-Connect with other members of the exciting Golf Rival community on Facebook and join the conversation\r\n\r\nJoin golf fans around the world and download Golf Rival to get started on your way to becoming an ultimate golf game champion!  \r\n\r\nGolf Rival is available in 13 languages. Join the Golf Rival community on Facebook!\r\n\r\nGolf Rival is FREE to download and includes optional in-game purchases (including random items). If you wish to disable in-game purchases, please turn off the in-app purchases in your phone or tablet\u2019s Settings.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The golf course is calling - it\u2019s time to become a pro golf champion in Golf Rival! <br><br>Golf Rival is a free-to-play multiplayer PvP golf game where great golf skills meet infinite golf creativity. Collect powerful golf clubs and balls and tee off across over 300+ courses in more than 20+ themes! Satisfy your golf dreams of hitting incredible shots, climbing the leaderboards and proving you\u2019re a golf game master. Let\u2019s go for a perfect swing and hit that hole-in-one, golfers!<br><br>This exciting free golf game has many modes to play and master, all from your mobile phone. From 1v1 PvP golf, to Tournament mode where it\u2019s you against the community of golfers around the world, to playing golf with friends - in Golf Rival, scoring a birdie is only the start of the competitive fun! Use powerful balls and clubs to outwit your opponent, as no two fun multiplayer golf battles are the same. <br><br>Golf Rival also now includes a brand-new MINI GOLF mode, complete with putt putt puzzles and mini golf battles designed to see if you\u2019re truly a top golfer. Think outside the box to solve these tricky holes with curves, power shots and more!<br><br>Grab your golf clubs, because Golf Rival has it all, whether you\u2019re a golfing games newbie or a sports game expert!<br><br>PLAY EXCITING GOLF GAMES<br>-Complete stages and unlock incredible new golf challenges to conquer by winning real-time golf battles<br>-Master your golf swing with precision and creativity to watch your skills grow<br>-Compete in both 9-hole and 18-hole Tournaments in every exciting season<br>-Multiplayer mode, mini golf mode and other challenges await for you to play every day<br>-Beautiful 3D golf courses of different themes and difficulties will always present a realistic golf challenge<br><br>GROW YOUR GOLF SKILLS<br>-Playing a golf simulation like Golf Rival is unlike any free golf games you\u2019ve tried before thanks to creative and fantastical clubs and balls<br>-Win to unlock amazing rewards to take onto the course for your next round and enhance your golf bag<br>-With every exciting real-time golf clash, you\u2019ll gain important skills and tricks to hit extreme golf shots!<br><br>INFINITE GOLF FUN<br>-Every Golf Rival season is fun and fresh, with new courses, balls and rewards appearing all the time!<br>-Golf ball games and skill games like Kingdom, Ace Open, Brink Game and more provide you with many fun spins on classic golf. <br>-Add your friends and see who has the swag golf skills needed to become the #1 golfer!<br>-Connect with other members of the exciting Golf Rival community on Facebook and join the conversation<br><br>Join golf fans around the world and download Golf Rival to get started on your way to becoming an ultimate golf game champion!  <br><br>Golf Rival is available in 13 languages. Join the Golf Rival community on Facebook!<br><br>Golf Rival is FREE to download and includes optional in-game purchases (including random items). If you wish to disable in-game purchases, please turn off the in-app purchases in your phone or tablet\u2019s Settings.",
